 *
 * Voice-search widget mount. Emits a config host element + the
 * external widget script (CSP-safe: no inline JS) + a minimal style block.
 * Renders nothing when the voice toggle is OFF. All labels through __().
 *
 * @var \Magento\Framework\View\Element\Template $block
